{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29519","headline":"肠 · 李商隐","name":"肠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有怀非惜恨，不奈寸肠何。\n即席回弥久，前时断固多。\n热应翻急烧，冷欲彻微波。\n隔树澌澌雨，通池点点荷。\n倦程山向背，望国阙嵯峨。\n故念飞书及，新懽借梦过。\n染筠休伴泪，绕雪莫追歌。\n拟问阳台事，年深楚语讹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}